      "type": "text",
      "text": "Anchor Books covers by Edward Gorey, 1925-2000. Clockwise from top left: 1958 (Francois Villon), 1965 (Dr. Caligari), 1955 (Amerika), 1956 (American Puritans), 1960 (German Poetry), 1956 (Thérèse)."
